WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:06.799
Speaker 1: Tucker Carlson is very concerned
about a floating space vagina.

00:00:06.799 --> 00:00:10.410
That is not a headline that I would have guessed.

00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:13.920
Two days ago I was going to be giving you
today.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:16.570
This is the epitome of everything is scary.

00:00:16.570 --> 00:00:23.220
I'm going to explain right wing fear mongering
to you with a segment in which Fox News propagandist

00:00:23.220 --> 00:00:30.349
Tucker Carlson is afraid of a Turkish floating
space vagina.

00:00:30.349 --> 00:00:31.349
What am I talking about?

00:00:31.349 --> 00:00:33.020
Okay, here's the deal.

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:35.610
In Turkey, there was a cloud.

00:00:35.610 --> 00:00:36.750
Okay.

00:00:36.750 --> 00:00:42.469
The cloud to some people looked like a vagina.

00:00:42.469 --> 00:00:45.060
And some of you will say, Well, David, really,
it's a vulva.

00:00:45.060 --> 00:00:47.700
The vagina is inside.

00:00:47.700 --> 00:00:49.789
We all know what I'm talking about, okay?

00:00:49.789 --> 00:00:53.180
We're using the colloquial term that is usually
used.

00:00:53.180 --> 00:00:57.320
Please, OB-GYNs, don't write to me about this.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:00:59.770
It was really not like a huge deal.

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:00.770
It's just a cloud.

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.800
I mean, quite literally, it's a cloud.

00:01:03.800 --> 00:01:06.240
But Tucker has to fearmonger.

00:01:06.240 --> 00:01:10.610
So he does a segment saying this is really
a problem.

00:01:10.610 --> 00:01:11.610
This is not normal.

00:01:11.610 --> 00:01:12.610
Take a look at this.

00:01:12.610 --> 00:01:17.280
We have seen pictures of the very strangely
shaped object that appeared in the skies over

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:18.390
Turkey.

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:19.490
Yeah.

00:01:19.490 --> 00:01:21.240
What is that exactly?

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:25.860
It's not normal no matter what they tell you.

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:31.180
Plus, tomorrow, millions of churchgoing Christians
in America still vote for the Democrat.

00:01:31.180 --> 00:01:35.350
Yeah, that he was moving on to his next scary
story that there are Christians who vote for

00:01:35.350 --> 00:01:36.490
Democrats.

00:01:36.490 --> 00:01:38.659
Maybe blame the vaccine would be a take away.

00:01:38.659 --> 00:01:39.659
All right.

00:01:39.659 --> 00:01:42.880
So, listen, this is it's so stupid, but this
is very, very instructive.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:44.750
And I'll explain to you why.

00:01:44.750 --> 00:01:51.890
Whether it's about big things or small things,
the right relies on fear mongering tactics

00:01:51.890 --> 00:01:55.829
to gain support and to push their agenda forward.

00:01:55.829 --> 00:01:58.400
If there is a specific person to blame.

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:01.530
Even better, if there's a particular group
to blame.

00:02:01.530 --> 00:02:03.710
Absolutely fantastic.

00:02:03.710 --> 00:02:09.459
It's a strategy that fear creates a sense
of urgency.

00:02:09.459 --> 00:02:12.030
We need to know what to do now.

00:02:12.030 --> 00:02:15.200
We need to know who is subjecting us to this.

00:02:15.200 --> 00:02:16.410
And on and on and on.

00:02:16.410 --> 00:02:19.550
The space vagina.

00:02:19.550 --> 00:02:23.160
He's using the same rhetoric he uses with
a lot of this other stuff.

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:25.850
I don't know that he's necessarily suggesting
an investigation.

00:02:25.850 --> 00:02:28.519
He just seems confused by it, I guess, in
some sense.

00:02:28.519 --> 00:02:32.989
But the way that this works is you use the
fear to create the sense of urgency and to

00:02:32.989 --> 00:02:37.550
otherize someone else, to agitate people,
to scare them, to say, well, tell me what

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:38.690
to do, please.

00:02:38.690 --> 00:02:39.690
You've scared me.

00:02:39.690 --> 00:02:41.580
Now what is it that I'm supposed to do?

00:02:41.580 --> 00:02:42.740
And that's the point.

00:02:42.740 --> 00:02:47.980
You use the fear to get people to take action
without fully considering the consequences.

00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:54.709
And this is why right wing politicians will
often use fear to try to push for quick and

00:02:54.709 --> 00:02:56.820
drastic changes to policies or laws.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:03:00.739
Guys, we don't have time to sit and think
about this and to debate it.

00:03:00.739 --> 00:03:03.680
There is a floating space vagina in Turkey.

00:03:03.680 --> 00:03:05.230
We've got to do something about it right now.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:07.640
Now, usually it's not a floating space vagina.

00:03:07.640 --> 00:03:13.299
It's immigrants or communism that doesn't
exist or Marxism that they don't understand

00:03:13.299 --> 00:03:16.069
that isn't Marxism or whatever the case may
be.

00:03:16.069 --> 00:03:20.180
But that's how you slip changes through quickly
that aren't actually in the best interests

00:03:20.180 --> 00:03:22.430
of the majority of people.

00:03:22.430 --> 00:03:29.489
Fear can also be used to create division and
distraction from actual issues.

00:03:29.489 --> 00:03:32.549
A floating space vagina is not a real issue.

00:03:32.549 --> 00:03:37.550
Tucker's one hour show, once you take commercials
away, is probably 38 minutes or 42, if it's

00:03:37.550 --> 00:03:41.750
like, you know, most corporate media shows
and every one of those minutes is going to

00:03:41.750 --> 00:03:45.370
something rather than something else.

00:03:45.370 --> 00:03:49.989
And when you do the space vagina thing, you
don't talk about an actual issue that affects

00:03:49.989 --> 00:03:51.090
people.

00:03:51.090 --> 00:03:55.200
And lastly, the fear is used to create an
us versus them mentality.

00:03:55.200 --> 00:04:02.520
Now, he didn't go in this direction, but the
Turkish floating space vagina could be used

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:05.940
to make the audience suspicious of what is
it that turkey is doing?

00:04:05.940 --> 00:04:07.750
What is Turkey up to exactly?

00:04:07.750 --> 00:04:11.590
Well, they have a floating penis soon, or
whatever the case may be.

00:04:11.590 --> 00:04:15.349
And it's part of this distraction method and
it fuels all of these other techniques that

00:04:15.349 --> 00:04:16.349
I talked about.

00:04:16.349 --> 00:04:17.989
So it's such a silly example.

00:04:17.989 --> 00:04:19.370
It's a small example.

00:04:19.370 --> 00:04:21.630
Although the cloud is quite large.

00:04:21.630 --> 00:04:27.720
It's a small example, small scale example
of how everything leads to the exact same

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.070
rhetoric and tone.

00:04:29.070 --> 00:04:35.190
And that's another fascinating and sort of
funny thing, whether Tucker is talking about

00:04:35.190 --> 00:04:42.360
a potential nuclear war or a floating space
vagina, his tone is exactly the same, which

00:04:42.360 --> 00:04:47.520
signals to people who have this stuff spoon
fed to them on Fox News.

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:51.380
They should be reacting with equal amounts
of fear to both of the things.

00:04:51.380 --> 00:04:59.180
So it's quite sophisticated propaganda and
it would be better if people were more prepared

00:04:59.180 --> 00:06:10.790
to defend themselves against it.

